if(a==='submit-book'){const c=getConsult(),service=activeBookingService(),dur=service?.duration??duration(c),start=+v;if((!service&&c.project!=='cut')||!dur)return toast('请先选择本次长发或短发');if(!c.name){openCustomerProfile();return toast('请先填写客户称呼，保存后即可预约');}const requested=SalonCore.services.needsOwnerConfirmation(service),contactPhone=$('#booking-contact-phone')?.value.trim();if(requested&&!SalonCore.services.validContactPhone(contactPhone))return toast('请填写有效的11位联系手机号');if(!canBook(day,start,dur))return toast('时间已变化或被占用，请重新选择');if(db.bookings.some(x=>x.client===client&&['pending','requested','confirmed'].includes(x.status)&&x.day===day&&x.start===start))return toast('已有这笔预约，请在我的记录查看');const booking={id:uid(),client,name:c.name,title:service?.name||c.plan?.title||'洗剪吹',project:service?.category||c.project,...(service?{serviceId:service.id,isHaircut:service.isHaircut}:{hair:cutBookingHair.get(client)}),day,start,duration:dur,end:start+dur,status:requested?'requested':'confirmed',...(requested?{contactPhone}:{}),price:c.plan?.price||'价格待正式确认',deposit:c.plan?.deposit||'定金规则待确认',created:Date.now()};if(booking.status==='confirmed')assignStaff(booking);db.bookings.push(booking);save();cutBookingHair.delete(client);panel='records';selected=null;render();toast(requested?'已提交申请，请查看确认状态':'已保存预约，请查看状态');return;}
if(a==='approve'){const order=db.bookings.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!order||!['requested','pending'].includes(order.status))return;if(!canBook(order.day,order.start,order.duration,order.replaces||id))return toast('候选时间已不可用，不能确认。请回复客户另选时间。');if(order.replaces){const old=db.bookings.find(x=>x.id===order.replaces);if(!old||old.status!=='confirmed')return toast('原预约已变化，请重新处理改期');old.status='cancelled';}order.status='confirmed';if(!assignStaff(order)){order.status=order.contactPhone?'requested':'pending';return toast('当前没有可分配的员工，请调整排班或时间');}Promise.resolve(save()).then(()=>{if(globalThis.SalonNetwork?.lastError)return toast(SalonNetwork.lastError);document.querySelector('.phone-sheet-backdrop')?._phoneClose();render();toast('预约已确认，客户端同步显示');});return;}
if(a==='reject'||a==='cancel-book'){if(!confirm(a==='reject'?'拒绝此申请？':'取消这笔预约？体验不处理实际退款。'))return;const order=db.bookings.find(x=>x.id===id);order.status='cancelled';save();render();toast('订单已取消，已占用时间释放');return;}
